  "sketch": "// Soil Moisture Sensor: V+ -> 5V, G -> GND, SIG -> A0\nconst int sensorPin = A0;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int reading = analogRead(sensorPin);\n  int moisture = map(reading, 0, 1023, 100, 0);\n  \n  Serial.print(\"Moisture: \");\n  Serial.print(moisture);\n  Serial.println(\" %\");\n  delay(1000);\n}\n",
